'''Anubis the Protector''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties: The Majestic Zeus]] and [[WAVE BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|WAVE BUSTERS]] events. He was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]] grants [[Immune to Knockback|Knockback Immunity]] and increased health and attack power. [[Talents]] were also added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]].

